[{"client_msg_id":"932ab514-4533-4ac4-9b80-df076ec052af","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ちょっと機能がおおいと functional test も複数ファイルにしたくなりそうだなーとは思っていますが、もう全部 1 ファイルに突っ込んでいる。。。","ts":"1624276937.085600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bst19"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2732ba62-5de8-435c-bd28-f74f1724f4a4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"特殊バッファを開くプラグインの場合はバッファの挙動についてのテストもしたくなる","ts":"1624276884.085000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vYNu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5fbf0d45-5366-4fe9-81b2-ba8c8831ef42","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"悩ましい","ts":"1624276849.084600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yPBqx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e7ebb19-02d6-43f7-8142-026298150a1e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(…) の定義などは `plugin/plugin-name.vim` に書いているし納得感はないこともないのですが、1 ファイルしか置けないのでちょっと微妙ですね。","ts":"1624276707.084400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SEJn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"806b5fec-5cea-47ea-a781-a21ce2541ca0","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"functional なテストを書く場合は答えがなくて上の例でいうと `spec/plugin/plugin-name.vimspec` に全部押し込めています。","ts":"1624276639.083300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+34"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af1f7b1a-9432-4b90-abd3-719eaa4e00d2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"試しにそうしてみようかな","ts":"1624276530.082700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yG2w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58252c3c-4cad-41cd-b764-14e769efebc4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なるほど。迷わなくていいですね","ts":"1624276523.082500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pLH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07acbd73-1302-4aed-8a34-28d1f48c61e0","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"autoload 配下にあるファイルと 1:1 になるようにテストファイルを書いています。（ディレクトリ構造も `autoload/**/*.vim` と `spec/autoload/**/*.vimspec` で対応づけてます。）","ts":"1624276461.081400","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1624276506.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"enqb6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb66db0e-8a15-4bee-94a2-912d5e846550","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Vim plugin のテスト、特にファイルの分割単位の習慣とかがないのでどうファイルを分けようかが毎回まちまちになってしまう","ts":"1624275853.080300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"orO"}]}]
